  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continued secondment of a Telecom expert, NN , to IMG in Sarajevo until October 1999, which has been going on since 1995. IMG is responsible for setting of wage, disbursements of wage, travelcosts etc. Sida supports with SEK 850 000.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fortsatt sekondering av teleexpert till IMG i Sarajevo t o m oktober, 1999. Sida har sedan april 1995 st&#xe4;llt NN  till IMG&apos;s f&#xf6;rfogande som teleexpert. IMG svarar f&#xf6;r l&#xf6;nes&#xe4;ttning, utbetalning av l&#xf6;nemedel, resekostnader etc. Sida st&#xf6;djer med totalt: 850 000 SEK.</narrative>
  </description>
